          <div class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you commit real months to this path</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether product management fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it in
    the real world before you spend months chasing a certificate or an unrealistic direct-entry job search.
  </p>

