    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you compare product management against adjacent tech and strategy paths with an actual person, instead
    of guessing alone from bootcamp marketing.
  </p>

  <h2 id="verdict">The verdict framework: not a flat yes or no</h2>

  <p>
    "Is product management a good career" does not have one correct answer for everyone. Use this framework
    instead of a single verdict.
  </p>

