  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Do not try to answer "is product management a good career" in the abstract for one more month based on one more
    bootcamp ad or one more idealised "visionary leader" pitch.
  </p>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
